     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Fri, Jan 22, 2016 at 5:09 PM, Malcolm Charles <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">malcolm...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br></div></div>"
