     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi,<div><br></div><div>I&#39;m constructing a Shiny app using leaflet that offers a variety of control to the user in terms of what cuts of data they want plotted and how it is plotted.</div><div><br></div><div>To that end, I have created a observe event which uses a series of if + else if statements to plot the proper map, depending on user input. See below (truncated example)</div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br> observe</span><span style=\"color:#660\">({</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#800\">### Storing Datasets </span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    dataset</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> zerg</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    ucdata</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> toss</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    <br><br><br><br><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#800\">### Color Palettes for Map</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    <br>    </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># colorData &lt;- ifelse(dataset$both == &quot;1&quot;, &quot;both&quot;, &quot;first_only&quot;)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#800\">#pal &lt;- colorFactor(c(&quot;Red&quot;, &quot;Green&quot;), colorData)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    pal </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> colorNumeric</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      palette </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;YlGnBu&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      domain </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> income_census$percent<br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    <br><br><br>    <br>    </span><span style=\"color:#800\">### Configure Popups</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    popupEVH </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> paste0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Member ID: &quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> dataset$member_id</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;&lt;br&gt;&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Attributed Physician: &quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> dataset$docID</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    popupUC </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  paste0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Member ID: &quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> ucdata$member_id</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;&lt;br&gt;&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Attributed Physician: &quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> ucdata$docID</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    <br>    <br>    </span><span style=\"color:#800\">### Plotting the Map</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    proxy </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> leafletProxy</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;map&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#008\">if</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input$view</span><span style=\"color:#660\">==</span><span style=\"color:#000\">TRUE </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&amp;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> input$crit</span><span style=\"color:#660\">==</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;EVH&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&amp;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> input$doc</span><span style=\"color:#660\">==</span><span style=\"color:#000\">FALSE </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&amp;&amp;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> input$census</span><span style=\"color:#660\">==</span><span style=\"color:#000\">FALSE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      proxy </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        clearMarkers</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> clearShapes</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> clearPopups </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> clearControls </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        store<br><br><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#008\">else</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">if</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input$view</span><span style=\"color:#660\">==</span><span style=\"color:#000\">TRUE </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&amp;&amp;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> input$crit</span><span style=\"color:#660\">==</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;EVH&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&amp;&amp;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> input$doc</span><span style=\"color:#660\">==</span><span style=\"color:#000\">TRUE </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&amp;&amp;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> input$census</span><span style=\"color:#660\">==</span><span style=\"color:#000\">FALSE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      proxy </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        clearMarkers</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> clearShapes</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> clearControls </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        addCircleMarkers</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(~</span><span style=\"color:#000\">longitude</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\">latitude</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> layerId</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=~</span><span style=\"color:#000\">member_id</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                                            stroke</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">FALSE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> fillOpacity</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.9</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> fillColor</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Red&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dataset</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> popup</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">popupEVH</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        addCircleMarkers</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(~</span><span style=\"color:#000\">longitude</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\">latitude</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> layerId</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=~</span><span style=\"color:#000\">docID</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> fillColor</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Green&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> stroke</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">FALSE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">docdata</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#008\">else</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">if</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input$view</span><span style=\"color:#660\">==</span><span style=\"color:#000\">TRUE </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&amp;&amp;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> input$crit</span><span style=\"color:#660\">==</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;EVH&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&amp;&amp;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> input$doc</span><span style=\"color:#660\">==</span><span style=\"color:#000\">TRUE </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&amp;&amp;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> input$census</span><span style=\"color:#660\">==</span><span style=\"color:#000\">TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      proxy </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        clearMarkers</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> clearShapes</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> clearControls </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        addPolygons</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">data </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> income_census</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>                fillColor </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\">pal</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">percent</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>                color </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;#b2aeae&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># you need to use hex colors</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                fillOpacity </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.4</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>                weight </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>                smoothFactor </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        addLegend</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">pal </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> pal</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>                values </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> income_census$percent</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>                position </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;bottomleft&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>                title </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Percent of Households&lt;br&gt;w/ under $50k income&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                labFormat </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> labelFormat</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">suffix </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;%&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        addCircleMarkers</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(~</span><span style=\"color:#000\">longitude</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\">latitude</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> layerId</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=~</span><span style=\"color:#000\">member_id</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                         stroke</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">FALSE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> fillOpacity</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.9</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> fillColor</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Red&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dataset</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> popup</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">popupEVH</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        addCircleMarkers</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(~</span><span style=\"color:#000\">longitude</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\">latitude</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> layerId</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=~</span><span style=\"color:#000\">docID</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> fillColor</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Green&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> stroke</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">FALSE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">docdata</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><div><div><br></div><div>        </div><div><br></div><div>The problem with using the if + else if + else if... is that I am repeating sections of code (such as the AddCircleMarkers in Red, above)... Is there a way for me to store these layers ONCE, and then construct my conditional tree in a much more readable way?</div><div><br></div><div>For example, I get errors when I try to do something like this:</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\"> observe</span><span style=\"color:#660\">({</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>    store</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">addCircleMarkers</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(~</span><span style=\"color:#000\">longitude</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\">latitude</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> layerId</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=~</span><span style=\"color:#000\">member_id</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>                     stroke</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">FALSE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> fillOpacity</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.9</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> fillColor</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Red&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dataset</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> popup</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">popupEVH</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    <br>    <br><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#800\">### Plotting the Map</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    proxy </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> leafletProxy</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;map&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#008\">if</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input$view</span><span style=\"color:#660\">==</span><span style=\"color:#000\">TRUE </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&amp;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> input$crit</span><span style=\"color:#660\">==</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;EVH&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&amp;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> input$doc</span><span style=\"color:#660\">==</span><span style=\"color:#000\">FALSE </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&amp;&amp;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> input$census</span><span style=\"color:#660\">==</span><span style=\"color:#000\">FALSE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      proxy </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        clearMarkers</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> clearShapes</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> clearPopups </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> clearControls </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        store<br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span></div></code></div><div><br>I get errors when R reaches the point where I&#39;m trying to save that layer to the &#39;store&#39; variable.</div><div><br></div><div>Any tips?</div><span><font color=\"#888888\"><div>   <br></div></font></span></div></div></div></blockquote></div></div>"
